        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 209,
        "headingId": 385,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>Classification using uterine-type smooth muscle criteria has been proposed for smooth muscle tumours of the broad ligament {30702465}.</p>\r\n",
